# hair/adult/ponytail_hang: the low Ponytail's tail: tied at the nape with a ribbon, hanging down the back to the shoulder
# blades; it lags the step (hair keys), flicks out past the neck facing down, and lies flat under a lying head (lie: none)
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair ponytail
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys hair
z 1

